As a Graphic Designer &amp; Production Artist, you'll be at the heart of the creative process—transforming concepts, sketches, and ideas into polished vector artwork, product designs, packaging, and marketing materials. Working alongside our Creative Director and talented design team, you'll ensure every detail is production-ready while maintaining the creativity and personality that make Spellbinders products special.&nbsp;


